<title>USA: Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.60		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			  77,000		   71,000</p>
<p> Net revs		  722,000		  750,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  117,206		  116,158</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net revenues is equal to total revenues less interest expense. Total revenues for the quarter were $3.59 billion versus $3.45 billion.  </p>
<p>			NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $2.28		    $1.27</p>
<p> Net			 289,000		  174,000</p>
<p> Net revs		2,376,000		2,188,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  116,300		  112,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total revenues, nine months, $10.45 billion versus $9.86 billion.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
